<designrules name="hw_DAA_Inner_Layers">
<description language="en">&lt;b&gt;EAGLE Design Rules Rigiflex PolyImide. For Inner Layers&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
These rules are from Lab Circuit Class 7 and Annular Ring Class 5</description>
